# Everything the test suite needs *except* a pinned `tox`, so that the
# `oldest-tox` lock beside it can swap which `tox` the tests run
# against without restating the rest of the list.
#
# NOTE: `tox`'s `[testing]` extra provides `devpi-process` / `pytest`
# NOTE: (needed by the `tox.pytest` plugin) starting from v4.54.0. They
# NOTE: are listed here rather than left to the extra so that both
# NOTE: locks get them whichever `tox` they pin.
# Ref: https://github.com/tox-dev/tox/issues/3938
covdefaults
coverage
devpi-process
pytest
pytest-cov
pytest-subtests
pytest-xdist
# NOTE: Unpinned. The ceiling that used to be here held the lock at
# NOTE: v4.64.0 because `_SeedLoader.substitute()` is reached through
# NOTE: the command line on v4.62.0 to v4.64.0 alone -- below that
# NOTE: `tox` does not expand an override's value at all, and from
# NOTE: v4.64.1 it builds a real config-file loader for the missing
# NOTE: section, which outranks the seed. The declared floor sits
# NOTE: below the whole band, so the method stays; what changed is
# NOTE: that the suite now calls it directly instead of hoping the
# NOTE: pinned release happens to route through it. A coverage gate
# NOTE: that only holds on three releases is a gate on this pin.
tox [testing]
